  "description": "The meme targets individuals who identify with or are perceived to fit the 'nerdy' or 'geeky' stereotype, characterized by high intelligence, academic focus, and often a perceived lack of physical agility or athleticism. The visual of the man with curly hair, glasses, and 80s-style clothing, along with the beige computer, is a classic representation of this archetype, making it relatable to those who recognize themselves in this portrayal.",
